# Project instructions (GitHub Copilot)

This project uses rtl-harness, checked out as the `{{harness_dir}}/` submodule. Copilot cannot
import files, so the harness rules are inlined below; edit `{{harness_dir}}/AGENTS.md` and
re-run `rtl-harness sync` instead of editing this file.

Tools: the `rtl-harness` MCP server registered in `.vscode/mcp.json` exposes run_lint,
run_sim, get_waveform and list_design (agent mode). Paths are relative to this project root.

